; The underside: darker and rougher than the near-black the arches are cut in,
; because everything down here is road-dirty pressed steel and this is the one
; part of the car that is never going to be washed. It is a shade off the arch
; material rather than the same one so that the floor pan and the wheel wells do
; not read as a single continuous object where they meet.
[sub_resource type="StandardMaterial3D" id="StandardMaterial3D_trim"]
albedo_color = Color(0.09, 0.09, 0.1, 1)
roughness = 0.9

